# SudoRGB: Corsair LCD panels (iCUE ELITE LCD cap, NAUTILUS LCD cap, XC7 ELITE LCD, iCUE LINK AIO/XD5 LCD).
# Grants the logged-in user access to the panel's hidraw node; nothing runs as root.
SUBSYSTEM=="hidraw", ATTRS{idVendor}=="1b1c", ATTRS{idProduct}=="0c33|0c39|0c42|0c43|0c4e|0c55|0c57", TAG+="uaccess"
